@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Digidoclocker)

[*] --> UserType

state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> Registration : [Citizen]
UserType --> Login : [Registered Citizen]

state Registration
Registration : entry / Get the Registration Details
Registration : if valid then Save User Details and Proceed to Login else End Process

state Login
Login : entry / Get the Login Details
Login : if correct then Proceed else Provide Multiple Attempts

state Citizen <<choice>>
Citizen : entry / Logged In
Citizen --> UploadDocuments : [DONE_WITH_UPLOADS] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Citizen --> ViewProfile : [VIEWING_PROFILE] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Citizen --> ApplyForCertificate : [APPLIED_FOR_CERTIFICATE] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Citizen --> ContinueUploadingDocuments : [NEEDS_MORE_UPLOADS] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Citizen --> Session : [Logout] : Done with Actions

state Registrar <<choice>>
Registrar : entry / Logged In
Registrar --> RequestCertificates : [REQUESTING_VERIFICATION] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Registrar --> RequestMultipleCertificates : [REQUESTING_MORE_CERTIFICATES] : COMPLETION_EVENT
Registrar --> Session : [Logout] : Done with Actions

state Session <<choice>>
Session : entry / User Actions
Session : end when DONE_WITH_ACTIONS : COMPLETION_EVENT
Session --> Citizen : [Citizen]
Session --> Registrar : [Registrar]

@enduml
